{"ts": 1791244521.5167391, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/environments.md", "section": "environments"}, "output": "# Agent environments\n\n## What an environment is\nState, observations, actions, dynamics. The reward is a separate claim about what matters.\n\n## Partial observability (POMDP)\nWhen the agent cannot see the full state it must maintain a belief and sometimes act to gather information. Measurement can be an action with a cost.\n\n## Attention as a hidden variable\nLearners do not read everything shown to them. Attention gates learning and drains with fatigue.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.25, "pomdp": 0.25, "pass_k": 0.25}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.0, "persistence": 0.6651150346978564, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791244522.232734, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "reader_peek_section", "args": {"path": "/course/readings/week3/evaluation.md", "section": "evaluation"}, "output": "# Evaluating agents\n\n## pass@k vs pass^k\npass@k: any of k runs succeeds. pass^k: all k succeed. Reliability is what deployment needs.\n\n## Proxy vs direct measures\nA quiz score is a proxy. Retention a week later is closer to the thing itself.\n", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.25, "pomdp": 0.25, "pass_k": 0.25}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.0, "persistence": 0.6651150346978564, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791244524.686291, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "notes_append", "args": {"note_id": "writeup", "text": "\n## Friday build requirements\n- Define the environment: state, observations, actions, and dynamics if relevant.\n- Report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\n- Read the week3 folder readings.\n\n## What has already been done\n- Draft already says the environment includes state = files + calendar and actions = open + send.\n- The student has started the writeup.\n\n## What still needs to be learned / done\n- Clarify observations and dynamics for the environment definition.\n- Understand pass^k and how to compute/report it.\n- Run or summarize results for at least 3 seeds.\n- Check whether the attention section is required; peer discussion suggests it may not be, but the instructor did not require it explicitly.\n\n## Key reading takeaways\n- An environment includes state, observations, actions, and dynamics.\n- If the agent cannot fully observe state, it is a POMDP and may need to act to gather information.\n- pass^k means all k runs succeed, unlike pass@k which means any one succeeds.\n- Reliability matters for deployment.\n\n## Suggested next steps\n1. Add a clean environment definition to the writeup.\n2. Add pass^k results for 3+ seeds.\n3. If needed, mention whether attention is in scope only if the build prompt asks for it."}, "output": "Appended.", "t": 0, "activity": [], "events": [{"type": "note_edit", "note_id": "writeup", "by": "agent"}], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.25, "pomdp": 0.25, "pass_k": 0.25}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 0.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9313219651533418, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.0, "persistence": 0.6651150346978564, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.3}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 0.0, "seen_posts": []}}
